+/* The current program for a backend that runs it itself (on the GPU).
+ * Per instruction, from the start slot to FINAL, 8 words:
+ *   [0] mac | ilu<<4 | mac_mask<<8 | ilu_mask<<12 | tdst<<16 | omask<<20
+ *       | from_ilu<<24 | to_out<<25 | final<<26
+ *   [1] oaddr
